('KR:graphic-designer','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,15,0,0,0,5,20,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','KECO 2025 4154 시각 디자이너 is the direct graphic-design anchor.','entry_level_basis','Reviewed visual-design programmes and portfolio-based entry support accessible graduate entry.','market_scope','Exact recurring 4154 vacancy, salary, shortage and growth series are not yet normalised.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Only entry accessibility and low universal licensing burden are credited.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:ux-designer','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,13,0,0,0,5,18,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','UX/UI design is kept as a restricted subset of broader KECO 4154 시각 디자이너.','entry_level_basis','Six reviewed design programmes provide related study pathways; portfolio and UX practice remain central.','market_scope','Broad 4154 observations are not treated as UX-only evidence.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Only entry accessibility and low licensing burden are credited.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:multimedia-designer','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,13,0,0,0,5,18,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','KECO 2025 4155 미디어 콘텐츠 디자이너 is the direct media-content design family.','entry_level_basis','Two direct digital-content/visual-media programmes plus related media programmes support entry.','market_scope','Adjacent broadcasting and software signals are not substituted for exact 4155 evidence.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Only entry accessibility and low licensing burden are credited.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:animator','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,10,0,0,0,5,15,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','KECO 2025 4143 만화가 및 만화영화 작가 includes animator work and is restricted here to animation.','entry_level_basis','The reviewed Digital Content programme is related rather than direct; reel and portfolio quality remain decisive.','market_scope','Broader content-industry demand is not converted into animator-only market points.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Conservative entry credit plus low licensing burden only.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:interior-designer','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,13,0,0,0,5,18,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','KECO 2025 4153 실내장식 디자이너 is a direct mapping.','entry_level_basis','One reviewed Interior Architecture Design programme is a direct study pathway.','qualification_note','Architect and construction execution duties remain separate and can carry other legal requirements.','market_scope','Exact recurring 4153 market evidence is not yet normalised.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:film-editor','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,13,0,0,0,5,18,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','KECO 2025 4166 영상·녹화 및 편집 기사 directly covers film/video editing.','entry_level_basis','Four reviewed media/visual-media programmes remain related study pathways.','market_scope','Broadcasting-sector observations are not substituted for exact 4166 evidence.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Entry accessibility and low licensing burden only.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:architect','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,8,0,0,0,1,9,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','KECO 2025 1401 건축가 is restricted to the CampCareer canonical 건축사 professional scope.','entry_level_basis','Seven reviewed architecture programmes are direct study links, subject to accreditation and professional eligibility.','qualification_note','Architect services require qualification examination and registration; education alone is not sufficient.','market_scope','Broader construction or architecture-sector demand is not used as exact architect market evidence.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Long regulated entry route keeps both entry and burden credit conservative.'),'2026-08-10'),
('KR:web-designer','2026-08-10',0,0,0,0,15,0,0,0,5,20,'career-opportunity-kr-v1','provisional',jsonb_build_object('classification_scope','Web Designer is an explicit subset of KECO 2025 4155 미디어 콘텐츠 디자이너.','entry_level_basis','Three reviewed visual/design programmes are related pathways and portfolio-based entry is relatively accessible.','market_scope','Broad 4155 data is not presented as web-designer-only evidence.','visa_scope','No occupation-specific visa credit is assigned.','score_scope','Only entry accessibility and low licensing burden are credited.'),'2026-08-10')
